WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
This game uses Swap opening and Renju rules.
First to make five in a row wins.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:20.999 line:0
Swap opening: the first player places three stones,
black, white, black. Stones never move.

00:00:20.999 --> 00:00:28.998 line:0
The second player picks a colour; black swaps sides.
Here white is kept, and white moves next.

00:00:28.998 --> 00:00:40.998 line:0
Then players alternate, each building a row.
The race is to be first to five.

00:00:40.998 --> 00:00:47.997 line:0
Fast-forward: both sides now have four in a row.
Black moves first and needs just one more.

00:00:47.997 --> 00:00:52.497 line:0
Black's turn: add the fifth stone.

00:00:52.497 --> 00:00:56.997 line:0
Five in a row wins; the line is highlighted.

00:00:56.997 --> 00:01:06.000 line:0
Black wins with five in a row.
A full board with no line is a draw.
